cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "Reference-Conditioned Distance Intervals on Unseen Camera Traps"
abstract: >-
  Code for turning one surveyed flag photo per trail camera into dense metric
  distance maps with 90% prediction intervals on later flag-free photos, using a
  4-parameter ground-plane calibration and a reference-conditioned network
  fine-tuned from Depth Anything V2.
